### 1. Create Transaction
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "TXN-DEMO-001",
  "customerId": "CUST-DEMO-001",
  "amount": 1250.50,
  "currency": "INR",
  "type": "PAYMENT"
}

### 2. Get Transaction
GET http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/TXN-DEMO-001

### 3. Update Status
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/TXN-DEMO-001/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}


### 4. Get Customer Transactions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/transactions?customerId=CUST-DEMO-001